<title>USA: First USA Paymentech offer at $34/shr.</title>
<headline>First USA Paymentech offer at $34/shr.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>First USA Paymentech Inc said it has priced its offerings of 2.8 million primary and 4.0 million secondary shares of common stock at $34 per share.</p>
<p>First USA Inc, which currently owns about 77 percent of the outstanding common stock of Paymentech, expects to own about 59 percent of the common stock of Paymentech (or about 57 percent if the underwriters' over-allotment options are exercised in full) following consummation of the offerings.</p>
</text>
